0 -14 Td
(    Mitigation: ML-KEM-768 with ephemeral session keys ensures historical forward secrecy.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  - Man-In-The-Middle (MITM): Modifies packets or redirects envelopes to wrong nodes.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(    Mitigation: Recipient binding in AAD + ML-DSA-65 signatures renders swaps unforgeable.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  - Compromised Worker Node: Attempts unauthorized lateral traversal to admin endpoints.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(    Mitigation: Strict Service DAG graph enforcement and deterministic privilege rules.) Tj
0 -14 Td
(  - Malicious Insider / Tamperer: Modifies local audit records to hide activity.) Tj
0 -14 Td
